      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The top displayed value is synced and controlled from the menu.\n\nThe bottom displayed value is derived from the top one using a 1d blendtree, and SHOULD display 1 minus the top value. It has a noop clip at input = 1, and a \"display 1\" clip at input = 0.\n\nHowever, on remotes, since the resting state of the bottom display gets \"rebaked\" as 1, and the 1d blendtree only has a clip that outputs 1, it always displays one on remotes.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
