      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can also confirm this is happening. People keep telling me my avatars are broken even though I haven't changed the FX at all, I only turned on the new FT system. Anything operating on those defaults, like empty off states or additive layers, is affected. I'm converting all of my avatars back to the old system until this is fixed. :(",
